<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - S.Africa details June gold/forex rese.</title>
<headline>TABLE - S.Africa details June gold/forex rese.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Reserve Bank detailed June combined gold and foreign exchange reserves as follows:</p>
<p>			    June '97	     May '97     June '96</p>
<p>Assets: (Rand millions)</p>
<p>  Gold		    5181.26	     5293.22     6627.05</p>
<p>  Foreign		16949.86	    16531.18     4626.57</p>
<p>  Total		  22131.12	    21824.40    11253.62</p>
<p>  Gold shr of total     23.41  pct	  24.25	 58.89</p>
<p>  Gold volume		3.77  million oz	3.83	  4.44</p>
<p>  Gold value	    1373.02  rand/oz  1383.70     1493.94</p>
<p>  Other liabilities	7.09  bln rand    7.51	  5.36</p>
<p>  Total liabilities     36.17  bln rand   38.19	 29.84</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)</p>
</text>
